nd</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Ellicott City</h2><p>Howard County · Flash flooding, Sewer and drain backup, Historic masonry damage</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/annapolis/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bay-sunset.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bay-sunset-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bay-sunset.webp 1023w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1023" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Central Maryland</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Annapolis</h2><p>Anne Arundel County · Tidal and nuisance flooding, Hurricane remnants, Tornadoes</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/frederick/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Capital Region</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Frederick</h2><p>Frederick County · Hail, Straight-line wind, Creek flooding</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/rockville/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/highrise.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/highrise-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/highrise.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Capital Region</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Rockville</h2><p>Montgomery County · Condo water leaks, Derecho wind and trees, Ice dams</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/bowie/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/suburban-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/suburban-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/suburban-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Capital Region</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Bowie</h2><p>Prince George’s County · Wind and tree damage, Aging roof disputes, Pipe leaks</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/waldorf/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-debris-homes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-debris-homes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-debris-homes.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Southern Maryland</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Waldorf</h2><p>Charles County · Tornadoes, Hurricane remnants, Straight-line wind</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/hagerstown/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snowy-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snowy-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snowy-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Western Maryland</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Hagerstown</h2><p>Washington County · Heavy snow and ice dams, Hail, Frozen pipes</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/cumberland/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/winter-lake.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/winter-lake-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/winter-lake.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Western Maryland</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Cumberland</h2><p>Allegany County · Heavy snow load, Ice dams, Frozen pipes</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/salisbury/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flooded-dock.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flooded-dock-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flooded-dock.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Eastern Shore</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Salisbury</h2><p>Wicomico County · Hurricane and tropical storm wind, Nor’easters, Wind-driven rain</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/service-locations/ocean-city/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ocean-city.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ocean-city-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ocean-city.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="710" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Eastern Shore</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Ocean City</h2><p>Worcester County · Hurricane wind, Nor’easters, Wind-driven rain</p><span class="more">Local page <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv"><div><p class="kicker dark">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across Maryland</h2></div><p>The same policy language plays out very differently in a Garrett County cabin, a Fells Point rowhouse and an Ocean City condo tower.</p></div><div class="regrows"><div class="regrow rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/winter-lake.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/winter-lake-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/winter-lake.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><p class="kicker dark">Garrett · Allegany · Washington</p><h2>Western Maryland</h2><p>Mountain snow, ice dams and frozen pipes in seasonal cabins; hail rolling off the ridges into the Hagerstown Valley; river flooding along the Potomac and its creeks.</p><p class="small">Oakland, Deep Creek Lake, Frostburg, Cumberland, Hancock, Hagerstown</p></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/rowhouses.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/rowhouses-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/rowhouses.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><p class="kicker dark">Baltimore City · Baltimore Co. · Howard · Anne Arundel · Harford · Carroll</p><h2>Central Maryland</h2><p>Brick rowhouses with low-slope roofs and shared party walls, flash floods in stream valleys like Ellicott City’s, derecho-felled oaks and spring hail in the northern suburbs.</p><p class="small">Baltimore, Towson, Catonsville, Ellicott City, Columbia, Annapolis, Bel Air, Westminster</p></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/highrise.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/highrise-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/highrise.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><p class="kicker dark">Montgomery · Prince George’s · Frederick</p><h2>Capital Region</h2><p>High-rise condos and HOA communities, 1950s–60s ramblers, big tree canopies that come down in derechos, and hail in the Frederick Valley.</p><p class="small">Rockville, Silver Spring, Gaithersburg, Bowie, Laurel, Frederick, Urbana</p></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-debris-homes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-debris-homes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-debris-homes.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><p class="kicker dark">Charles · Calvert · St. Mary’s</p><h2>Southern Maryland</h2><p>Tornado history around La Plata, tropical-storm wind and tidal flooding on the Patuxent and Potomac shores, and fast-growing subdivisions around Waldorf.</p><p class="small">Waldorf, La Plata, Prince Frederick, Solomons, Lexington Park, Leonardtown</p></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ocean-city.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ocean-city-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ocean-city.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="710" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><p class="kicker dark">Nine counties from Cecil to Worcester</p><h2>Eastern Shore</h2><p>Hurricane and named-storm deductibles, wind-driven rain, low-lying farmland and waterfront towns, and salt-air wear on Ocean City’s condo towers.</p><p class="small">Elkton, Chestertown, Easton, Cambridge, Salisbury, Crisfield, Berlin, Ocean City</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your town?</h2><p>We cover every Maryland county. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btns"><a class="btn brass" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/start-a-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
